VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'temperature, and so on. You guys get the point. So, after running the workflow with the flux mask enhancer enabled, you\'ll see that all of the edges are a lot cleaner, the quality of the photo is'

[12:17] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
